      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Changes Requested**\n\nThe test suite covers the normal case and a full rollover, but is missing explicit boundary value tests for the `0x00400000U` (or `TRACK_ROLLOVER_THRESHOLD`) rollover threshold. For relational comparisons, please include tests verifying both the exact boundary (which should not increment) and the off-by-one adjacent value (which should increment).\n\n```c\n\t/* Test boundary condition: exact threshold (should NOT increment hi) */\n\tclksrc_high \u003d 0;\n\tmock_hw_timer \u003d 0x80000000;\n\ttimer_reset_track_packed_32bit();\n\tt1 \u003d get_time_32bit();\n\n\tmock_hw_timer \u003d 0x80000000 - 0x40000000; /* Diff is exactly 0x40000000 (\u003e\u003e 8 is 0x400000) */\n\tt2 \u003d get_time_32bit();\n\tzassert_equal(t2.le.hi, 0, \"hi should not increment at exact threshold\");\n\n\t/* Test boundary condition: threshold + 1 (should increment hi) */\n\tmock_hw_timer \u003d 0x80000000 - 0x40000000 - 0x100; /* Diff is threshold + 1 */\n\tt3 \u003d get_time_32bit();\n\tzassert_equal(t3.le.hi, 1, \"hi should increment just past threshold\");\n```\n[🔗](http://go/tj/4404ef33-8178-4b25-9e17-96e783966b04)",
